Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:18.80,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,600)}Suavemente
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.80,0:03:20.34,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,600)}Suavemente
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.34,0:03:26.06,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,600)}Vamos sentir o coração uma da outra
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.06,0:03:36.52,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,600)}Compartilhamos o calor dos nossos corpos
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.52,0:03:41.61,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,600)}Rindo sem motivo, brincando
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.61,0:03:47.16,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,600)}É um segredo que fica entre nós, prometo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.16,0:03:51.96,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,600)}Caminhando lado a lado,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:57.55,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,600)}Vamos ficar juntas para sempre
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.55,0:04:05.72,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,600)}Depois da escola, sempre conversamos
